# Testing

## Layers

| Layer | Approach |
|-------|----------|
| Unit | Vitest per package under `src/**/*.test.ts(x)` |
| API / worker | Prefer **in-memory** repositories from `@repo/firestore-converters`; wire via `buildServer({ repositories })` patterns |
| Integration | Firestore / Auth emulators when Admin SDK behavior matters |
| E2E | Cypress (`pnpm --filter web cypress`) |
| Visual | Playwright under `@repo/ui` (`pnpm test:visual`) |
| Manual | `docs/guides/e2e-validation-runbook.md` |

## AI

- Mock Vertex locally (e.g. `--mock-vertex` / documented test doubles) — do not burn quota in unit tests.
- New AI features: include spend-limit coverage and controller / orchestrator unit tests.
- In-memory vector indexes are process-local — do not assume persistence across restarts.

## Habits

- Colocate tests with code; mirror existing naming (`*.integration.test.ts` when needed).
- Prefer deterministic clocks / injected `now` where jobs depend on time.
- Keep fixtures minimal — no real tenant catalogs from `.local/` in main-tree tests.

## Enforcement

- `pnpm test` / `test:coverage` in `validate:ci`
- Cypress step in validate pipeline
- Package-level `pnpm --filter <pkg> test` while iterating

